message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "OEM: Operational Evidence Model"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Doctoral research at the University of Minho on validating and justifying
  operational data from cyber-physical systems before it is anchored as
  evidence: an ordinal trust function, conditions for evidential status, a
  no-trust-amplification rule for derived and AI-generated records, and a
  per-record justification.
keywords:
  - provenance
  - evidence
  - blockchain
  - auditability
  - cyber-physical systems
  - AI Act
